ing benefit from tariff refunds which was largely offset by an inventory reserve against our Neutron Flight II launch vehicle.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/17/rocket-lab-rklb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RKLB 2026 Q2","e":"rklb","d":"2026-08-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Peter Beck","x":"We can also introduce efficiencies and streamline the deployment of new infrastructure by building and launching our own spacecraft, limiting the costs and risks associated with third parties.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/17/rocket-lab-rklb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RKLB 2026 Q2","e":"rklb","d":"2026-08-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Peter Beck","x":"We streamline it, introduce efficiencies, scale production and, in many cases, introduce new capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/17/rocket-lab-rklb-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RKLB 2026 Q3","e":"rklb","d":"2026-11-09","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Adam Spice","x":"Consistent with our Q3 guidance, margins declined sequentially, primarily driven by the first full quarter contribution from our recent acquisition, Mynaric, which brings laser communications capabilities to our portfolio as well as the lack of tariff refunds that benefited Q2 margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/rocket-lab-rklb-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RKLB 2026 Q3","e":"rklb","d":"2026-11-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Adam Spice","x":"So, I think you're going to see price increases across Electron and HASTE.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/rocket-lab-rklb-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[62,1,12376,0,0,0,4579,7079],[64,1,13593,0,0,0,11610,1210],[65,1,11495,0,0,0,8976,1632],[66,1,11006,0,0,0,9503,1153],[67,1,12304,0,0,0,5317,6576]],"cinema":[[62,1,12376,0,0,0,4579,7079]